# Consolidate the old Netlify address onto the real domain.
# Every econsultantsglobaltiija.netlify.app URL permanently redirects to the
# same path on econsultantsglobaltiija.com.ng, so Google transfers the old
# listings instead of keeping two copies of the site. The "!" forces the rule
# even though a prerendered file exists at that path.
# Deploy previews use a different hostname and are unaffected.
https://econsultantsglobaltiija.netlify.app/*  https://econsultantsglobaltiija.com.ng/:splat  301!
http://econsultantsglobaltiija.netlify.app/*   https://econsultantsglobaltiija.com.ng/:splat  301!

# No SPA catch-all: every real page is prerendered to its own HTML file, and
# anything else falls through to 404.html with a proper 404 status.
